{"3093740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Helm - Desolated Forest", "steam_appid": 3093740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093740/extras/053e6da2b3a3fdc73147b7b2bb463d68.avif?t=1783438860\" width=1000 height=838 /></span><i>In a desolate forest under the rule of the fearsome Velkarion empire, a long forgotten fortress hides ancient secrets and unimaginable dangers. Where a dark plot unfolds as forces of Chaos and Order fight for dominion over the region.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093740/extras/462ebc63ebffdb7b73fb85e3908ff936.webp?t=1783438860\" width=300 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interact with the world through descriptions from <strong>narrative</strong> events in an experience that recaptures the immersion of <strong>classic dungeon crawlers</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093740/extras/e79e3e231aed0a8e28720cdb0b12a573.webp?t=1783438860\" width=300 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master <strong>turn-based combat</strong> where your skills define your allegiance to the forces of Order or Chaos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093740/extras/8399ba02161f1dac713cc183b1b5ef10.webp?t=1783438860\" width=300 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a <strong>Dungeon Synth</strong> inspired soundtrack.</p>", "about_t